permit (principal is User, action == Action::"performCalibration", resource is Asset)
when { ((((principal.certLevel == 0) || (principal.certLevel == 1) || (principal.certLevel == 2) || (principal.certLevel == 3)) && ((resource.equipmentClass == 0) || (resource.equipmentClass == 1) || (resource.equipmentClass == 2) || (resource.equipmentClass == 3)) && (resource.measurementPointCount >= 0)) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"CalibrationTechnician") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"SeniorTechnician"))) && (!(true) || (principal.certLevel >= resource.equipmentClass) || (context.emergencyDeclared && (principal.roles.contains(Role::"CalibrationTechnician") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"SeniorTechnician")))) && (!(true) || (resource.status == AssetStatusValue::"due")) && (context.cleanRoomCertified) && (!((resource.measurementPointCount > 10)) || context.performCalibrationV7ReviewCompleted)) };
